<p>PRTG Network Monitor is an all-in-one network monitoring solution from Paessler. With 250+ sensor types covering network traffic, bandwidth, servers, applications, and cloud services, PRTG is a popular choice for SMBs and enterprises alike.</p>
<p>PRTG includes AI-assisted anomaly detection and smart baselining to reduce false positives. Its auto-discovery feature scans your network and automatically creates sensors for discovered devices, making initial setup remarkably easy.</p>
<p>The platform's strength is its breadth — it can monitor virtually anything with a single tool. While not as deep as specialized solutions, it excels at providing unified visibility across diverse infrastructure.</p>
